VALUES (231, 'tt0365737', NULL, 'Syriana', 'Syriana', 'movie', 2005, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mO3hWUTOxmLJxihvDU0YFkb0Mb5.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xSUsz5n5qtR9yEwmRxEmYvMLN7o.jpg', 'The Middle Eastern oil industry is the backdrop of this tense drama, which weaves together numerous story lines. Bennett Holiday is an American lawyer in charge of facilitating a dubious merger of oil companies, while Bryan Woodman, a Switzerland-based energy analyst, experiences both personal tragedy and opportunity during a visit with Arabian royalty. Meanwhile, veteran CIA agent Bob Barnes uncovers an assassination plot with unsettling origins.', NULL, NULL, 6.5509, 6.418, 0, 8.425, '2026-07-20 01:02:04', '2026-11-19 13:22:38')
