VALUES (15383, 'tt0064040', NULL, 'Army of Shadows', 'L''Armée des ombres', 'movie', 1969, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aqNZWM9bspt8zaDvVRIRiWxRVJ7.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8tuIe9tMGsD47cgWdjux4aqdAaq.jpg', 'Betrayed by an informant, Philippe Gerbier finds himself trapped in a torturous Nazi prison camp. Though Gerbier escapes to rejoin the Resistance in occupied Marseilles, France, and exacts his revenge on the informant, he must continue a quiet, seemingly endless battle against the Nazis in an atmosphere of tension, paranoia and distrust.', NULL, NULL, 2.8659, 7.887, 0, 8.40285714285714391e+00, '2026-07-20 01:02:04', '2026-11-19 13:22:38')
